{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_01_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" />Real-Time Strategy Returns on a Larger Scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/1.jpg?t=1743251282\" />Apoceus: Winter Wars is a fantasy real-time strategy game that focuses on bringing back all the classical elements from the past, such as resource gathering, recruiting &amp; controlling armies, and base building, but on a much bigger scale.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Large Scale</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Base Building &amp; R</i>esource<i> gathering</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Fantasy</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Multiplayer</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_04_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe that base building and resource gathering have always been the core pillars of an exciting RTS experience. In <i>Apoceus: Winter Wars</i>, we\u2019re bringing back that classic feeling you know and love and enchant it on a scale that has never been seen in a fantasy RTS before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_02_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your <span class=\"bb_strike\">unit</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">units</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">groups</span>, ARMIES of hundreds (with a goal of thousands) of unique single entities and lead them into devastating battles in multiplayer to annihilate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_03_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" />Select one of three possible generals, each with their own unique traits and units. The goal is to annihilate your enemy's general by any means necessary.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_05_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Apoceus: Winter Wars we take scale even further, in the final version. you will be able to control enormous units, known as Titans and lay waste to your enemies.<br>Each General will come with their own unique Titan.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/4.jpg?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We want you for RTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small indie studio, and we want to create <i>Apoceus: Winter Wars</i> together with our beloved community and devoted real-time strategy enthusiasts from every part of the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your voice heard \u2014 join our Discord and let's make the best fantasy large-scale RTS game together. \u2764\ufe0f Wishlist and follow our social media to become a part of our RTS community.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1841690?t=1743251282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743251282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743251282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743251282","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_01_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" />Real-Time Strategy Returns on a Larger Scale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/1.jpg?t=1743251282\" />Apoceus: Winter Wars is a fantasy real-time strategy game that focuses on bringing back all the classical elements from the past, such as resource gathering, recruiting &amp; controlling armies, and base building, but on a much bigger scale.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Large Scale</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Base Building &amp; R</i>esource<i> gathering</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Fantasy</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Multiplayer</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_04_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We believe that base building and resource gathering have always been the core pillars of an exciting RTS experience. In <i>Apoceus: Winter Wars</i>, we\u2019re bringing back that classic feeling you know and love and enchant it on a scale that has never been seen in a fantasy RTS before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_02_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your <span class=\"bb_strike\">unit</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">units</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">groups</span>, ARMIES of hundreds (with a goal of thousands) of unique single entities and lead them into devastating battles in multiplayer to annihilate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_03_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" />Select one of three possible generals, each with their own unique traits and units. The goal is to annihilate your enemy's general by any means necessary.<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/Apoceus_GIF_Video_05_Resize.gif?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Apoceus: Winter Wars we take scale even further, in the final version. you will be able to control enormous units, known as Titans and lay waste to your enemies.<br>Each General will come with their own unique Titan.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/extras/4.jpg?t=1743251282\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>We want you for RTS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We are a small indie studio, and we want to create <i>Apoceus: Winter Wars</i> together with our beloved community and devoted real-time strategy enthusiasts from every part of the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get your voice heard \u2014 join our Discord and let's make the best fantasy large-scale RTS game together. \u2764\ufe0f Wishlist and follow our social media to become a part of our RTS community.</p>","developers":["Landell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841690/header.jpg?t=1743251282","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":256946559,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256946559/movie480.mp4?t=1698877601","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256946559/movie_max.mp4?t=1698877601"},"name":"Main Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256946559/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1698877601","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256946559/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1698877601","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/256946559/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1698877601"}}],"name":"Apoceus: Winter Wars","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> TBA</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Landell Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai